1
00:00:00,090 --> 00:00:01,065
Don't eat that cube

2
00:00:01,065 --> 00:00:02,120
you found!

3
00:00:02,120 --> 00:00:03,733
It's wombat POOP.

4
00:00:03,791 --> 00:00:04,420
And no,

5
00:00:04,420 --> 00:00:05,830
its butt isn't square.

6
00:00:05,830 --> 00:00:07,933
Its GUT makes the corners.

7
00:00:08,270 --> 00:00:10,180
See those two stiff stripes?

8
00:00:10,180 --> 00:00:11,440
Every squeeze,

9
00:00:11,440 --> 00:00:12,850
they pull in faster...

10
00:00:12,850 --> 00:00:14,433
and pinch corners.

11
00:00:14,482 --> 00:00:15,690
Why cubes?

12
00:00:15,690 --> 00:00:17,870
Wombats leave poop on rocks,

13
00:00:17,870 --> 00:00:18,833
like notes.

14
00:00:18,870 --> 00:00:19,751
Scientists think

15
00:00:19,751 --> 00:00:21,230
round notes...

16
00:00:21,260 --> 00:00:22,700
would roll off.

17
00:00:22,740 --> 00:00:24,290
Factories need molds

18
00:00:24,290 --> 00:00:25,833
or knives for cubes.

19
00:00:25,890 --> 00:00:26,850
Wombats?

20
00:00:26,850 --> 00:00:28,025
Up to a hundred

21
00:00:28,025 --> 00:00:28,920
a day...

22
00:00:28,920 --> 00:00:30,200
from salad.

23
00:00:30,264 --> 00:00:31,310
So...

24
00:00:31,310 --> 00:00:32,669
found a cute little cube

25
00:00:32,669 --> 00:00:34,033
on a log?

